1
00:00:00,218 --> 00:00:01,548
(Raj:)Nice to meet you.
- You too.

2
00:00:01,761 --> 00:00:03,721
(Raj:)Please, have a seat.

3
00:00:04,264 --> 00:00:06,144
(Raj:)I'm thinking double wedding.

4
00:00:11,062 --> 00:00:13,272
(Voice of Spock:)Dr. Cooper.

5
00:00:15,692 --> 00:00:17,732
(Voice of Spock:)Dr. Cooper?

6
00:00:19,028 --> 00:00:20,278
ls someone there?

7
00:00:20,488 --> 00:00:22,368
(Spock:)Down here. On your desk.

8
00:00:27,328 --> 00:00:30,788
(Sheldon:)- Spock?
- I need to speak with you.

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,290
(Sheldon:)Fascinating.

10
00:00:34,502 --> 00:00:37,792
(Sheldon:)The only logical explanation
is that this is a dream.

11
00:00:38,006 --> 00:00:40,546
(Spock:)It is not the only logical explanation.

12
00:00:40,758 --> 00:00:42,928
(Spock:)For example,
you could be hallucinating...

13
00:00:43,136 --> 00:00:47,596
(Spock:)...after being hit on the head by,
say, a coconut.

14
00:00:49,392 --> 00:00:51,392
Was I hit on the head by a coconut?

15
00:00:51,603 --> 00:00:55,023
I am not going to dignify that
with a response.

16
00:00:56,024 --> 00:00:57,354
(Spock:)Now to the matter at hand.

17
00:00:57,567 --> 00:01:00,317
(Spock:)You need to play with the Transporter toy.

